#AREA Hirudinia~
#AUTHORS Ozman Adidas Budreau~
#RANGES 75 95 55 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#TEMPERATURE 70 80 25 5



#HELPS
-1 Hirudinia~
Hirudinia is a small mining colony deep within the heart of the Chaos 
territories.  Its people, the Hirudines, mine the land for magic, which they feed 
off of to live and which they give to their Lord, the God of Entropy, Chaos to 
power his desire for change.  The Hirudines are decendants of the same race that
spawned Gozai, the titan and the slaads of Entropy. It is rumored that Gozai had also
helped to build much of the city of Hirudinia. 
Recently, a powerful witch has taken over the Hirudine's underground mining operation 
and is sapping the ground of all its magical energy.


Hirudinia created by Ozman  1-99
Updated by Ozman 08-29-2001
Version 4.3
~
-1 hirudinia_changes~
Updated September, 1999: Quest and mobs changed. Fixed bug.
Updated October, 1999: New quest and eq added.
Updated October, 2000: Quest bits problem fixed.
Updated March, 2001: Rescale changed, book bits problem fixed. Western exit 
		changed (adjust roads and kisangani).
Updated August 29, 2001: Adjusted anti-order code.
~
0 $~


