#29401
Hirudine citizen~
A Hirudine citizen~
A Hirudine citizen is here.~
A citizen of this great city, his skin is as bright as the sunlight.  
Standing over seven feet tall, he has a very imposing stature much like 
Gozai, but a kind demeanor.  You can see the energy flashing in his eyes.  
His magical prowess is incredible.
~
