Maynard man strange selling~
Maynard~
A strange man is selling items from behind the counter.~
With only one glance at this man, you can see that he is a troubled soul.  
Completely bald and naked, he feels perfectly at home with customers in his 
store.  He has an interesting tattoo of a spine along his back.  His 
demented look, and lack of clothing, sends chills up and down your back.
