>speech_prog lost soul~
say You've heard about me, eh? 
say Yeah, I've been known to deal in souls occassionally.
say But I think I really know what you're looking for.
mpecho $i gives you a sly, decadent grin.
say Anyway, one of the city beggars ran off with some
say of my best stuff.  The fella stumbled in here and wanted 
say a quick fix, so that's all I gave him.  But he ran out 
say and never paid me.  If you can get my junk back, I can 
say let you in on one of Lord Chaos' little secrets.
wink
~
