#29435
bishop marshall chaos slaad~
Bishop Marshall~
A bishop of Chaos awaits your journey.~
Clad in the Holy Chaotic Robes given to him by Lord Chaos himself, this 
slaad was designated to serve the city.  As he opens his cloak, you can 
see the far stretches of the universe inside, as time and space have no 
boundaries in the realm of Chaos.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
99 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 30d69+20000 2d50+45
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 6, $n) == 0
  say Our city is in grave danger.  A vile and evil
  say creature is sapping the mines of the powerful
  say magic that we live on and give to the great 
  say Lord Chaos.
  say Will you help us?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes sure yep ok~
if whichgod($n) == 1
say Why would I want help from any scum of Order?
mpforce $n say You Chaos prick, you'll feel my blade!
mpforce $n kill bishop
else
if quest(0, 6, $n) == 0
  say It is a long journey though the mines.
  say Talk to the owner of the mines before you leave.
  say Tell him why you are here.
  mpmset $n quest 0 6 1
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog magic~
if quest(0, 6, $n) == 16
  say Yes, there is only one person who can possibly
  say help you.  There is a wise sage who makes his home
  say in the city somewhere.  Find him, he owes me a favor.
  mpmset $n quest 0 6 17
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 6, $n) == 21
  say You have betrayed our great god Chaos.  You  
  say must be out of your mind.
  mpquiet on
  mpoload 29471
  mpquiet off
  mpmset $n quest 0 6 22
endif
~
>fight_prog 99~
if whichgod($n) == 1
mpquiet on
cast curse
cast curse
cast faerie fire
mpquiet off
cast 'energy drain'
cast 'energy drain'
endif
~
>speech_prog lost soul~
say I cannot help you, for I am only here to
say give guidance to the lost souls and help 
say them choose the path.
~
|
