A citizen of this great city, his skin is as bright as the sunlight.  
Standing over seven feet tall, he has a very imposing stature much like 
Gozai, but a kind demeanor.  You can see the energy flashing in his eyes.  
His magical prowess is incredible.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_CURSE 
0 S
80 BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HEAD BODY_FOOT|BODY_HAND|BODY_TORSO 1d2500+4550 1d60+40
200000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
  if reinc($n) > 0
    if whichgod($n) == 2
      rescale 29464 $n 150
    else
      rescale 29464 $n 85
    endif 
  endif
endif
if whichgod($n) == 1
shout M'Lord, stagnant Order wenches have infiltraded our fair city!
mpkill $n
endif
~
>fight_prog 75~
if whichgod($n) == 1
cast curse
cast 'energy drain'
cast acid blast
endif
~
|
