miner~
A Hirudine miner~
A miner is here digging in the ground.~
A large creature, standing well over seven feet tall, carrying only a torch and 
a pick.  His clothes have been blackened from the coal dust in the mine.  A 
bead of sweat drips down his dirty face, but you can still see the glow of 
his skin.
~
