#29485
beggar~
A beggar~
A beggar is here, asking for hand outs.~
Lacking magical power, but too proud to hide like the outcast that he is, 
this once wealthy man has resorted to a life of crime, begging for handouts 
and stealing from unsuspecting travelers.  A faint glow still resides in 
his eyes.
~
