As the sweat builds up on the back of your neck, you realize that you are 
in for the fight of your soon to be short life.  The smell of death is in 
the air, and you hear your name echoing from crevices all around you.  If 
you had only known what you were getting yourself into before you started, 
things would have been different.
~
