#29511
The Golden Dome~
Upon entering this beautiful golden palace, one first notices the intricate 
artwork so delicately engraved into the dome with images of the creation of 
magic.  Each etching is a truly magical occurrence, and truly a gift from 
the gods. There are no words, only pictures, with the exception of the 
letters... McD.  Each picture has a different motif showing Hirudines and 
slaads giving praise to their Lord, Chaos.  One motif in the center of the
northern wall shows the cities of Entropy and Hirudinia, with Gozai, the
Titan, standing high above them observing their creations.  There is a 
beautiful skylight in the center of the dome, from which you can see the 
Pillars of Magic reaching into the skies.
~
