#29530
Pillars of Magic~
There are seven pillars here, reaching to the sky.  They are arranged in a 
large semicircle surrounding the fountain.  Each pillar represents a 
specific component of magical power.  There are specific relationships 
between each pillar and the one next to it.  These relationships are for 
the true magical beings to learn and to live by.
~
