#29531
A large house~
This is the largest, most expensive building owned my the richest mining 
tycoon in the realms.  Every wall is carved from marble, laced in platinum 
and gold.  The floors are pure silver adorned with incredible life-sized 
crystalline statues that seem to move almost as if they were alive.
~
