#29535
Maynard's House of Magik~
This shop has the most insane mix of magic and ritualistic items anywhere 
in the realms.  Dead beasts hang behind the counter on large meathooks, 
while strange smelly green herbs and incense collect dust in the countertop.
Scrolls and potions promising true out of body experiences call out to 
every customer by name.
~
