#29538
Guild of Magik~
Magic bellows from every inch of the practice room.  A beautiful magical 
glow engulfs everything here, from the walls to the master sorcerer waiting 
here to help you hone your skills.  Strange magical runes are embedded on 
platinum plates on the walls.
~
