#29540
Entrance to the mine~
This is the entrance to the Hirudinian mine of magic, where the faithful 
citizens mine the ground in search of magical energies.  In the process, 
they also mine precious metals with which they build their fabulous homes 
and buildings.  The magic that gushes forth from the mine can enhance both 
your mind and your life.
~
