#29543
Great Hall of the Slaad~
This is a common meeting room for the followers of the great Lord Chaos. On
the walls are paintings of some of his greatest champions.  The floor is lined
with a very posh, plush black carpet with the Symbol of Chaos embroidered in 
the center. Two statues stand in the farthest corners of the room.  The statue 
on the left is of a large and imposing figure with a very Disturbing look on his 
solemn face.  On the right, you see a slightly smaller statue of the Divine and 
Devoted one, Sir Ozman, High Protector of Chaos.
~
