Guild of the Sword~
The fine craftmanship of the guildhouse is second to none.  A magical 
housing, standing to empower the less fortunate to train their skills, is 
truly a unique occurrence.  The great magicians have found that, although 
you are second rate to them, there is still a place in this world for you.  It is of course a cruel trick by god to deprive you of magic.
~
