#29547
The Pointed Finger~
The Pointed Finger Inn is a true testament to the power that magic holds
over the citizens of this fair city.  There is a large pewter sculpture of
a hand, pointing a finger in shame to every non-magic user who enters the
city. It is merely a reminder to the citizens here that using the powers of
the mind to hone your magic skills shall redeem your soul.
~
